    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3[a]">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAs">V As</ref> 3[a]</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ man singe ælc Frigdæge æt ælcum mynstre ealle þa Godes þeowan an fiftig [sealmas] for þone cyng ⁊ for ealle þe willaþ ðæt he wile ⁊ for þa oþre, swa hy geearnian.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And in every monastery, all the servants of God shall sing every Friday fifty psalms for the king, and for all who are minded to carry out his wishes. And [they shall sing psalms] for these others according to their merits.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And mon singe ylce Frigdæge æt ylcum mynstre ealle ða Goddes þeowas an fiftig sealmas for ðone cyng ⁊ for ealle ða ðe willen þæt he wille ⁊ for ða oþre, swa hi swa geearnigen.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
